<section class="section gs-intro">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Get started</p>
    <h1>From a folder of notes to agents that read them</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This walkthrough starts with the smallest setup — a local stdio server for Claude Code — then moves to the
      Docker image with a token and the web UI, and ends with a hook that adds related notes to every turn. The
      screenshots show the web UI in light mode.
    </p>
    <nav class="gs-toc">
      <a href="#stdio">1 · Local, over stdio</a>
